      "id": "teach_5",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Pairwise averages are also partial sums.\n\nIf A and B average 20, then A+B=40.\nIf B and C average 25, B+C=50.\nIf A and C average 30, A+C=60.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_5_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_5_step": {
      "id": "teach_5_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Add all three equations:\n2(A+B+C)=150\nA+B+C=75\n\nThen B = 75 − (A+C) = 15.\n\nThe pairwise sums reveal the individual values.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_5"
        }
      ]
    },
